s purely educational and aligns with the stated purpose.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163545970},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":4,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789063941043},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a plain Office productivity reference skill with no executable behavior, persistence, credential handling, or hidden data movement.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill does not request environment access; any handling of office files or recipient lists would occur only through normal user-directed office workflows.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No install scripts, dependencies, executable files, network fetches, or setup commands were found in the inspected artifact files.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The content is advisory markdown only. SKILL.md references tools/ and admin/ paths that are not present in the package layout, while equivalent root-level files exist; this is a functionality/packaging note, not a security concern.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background workers, memory writes, tool wrapping, or credential/session access were present.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifacts provide guidance for spreadsheets, documents, presentations, and office administration, matching the stated Office productivity purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Installers should treat this as general Office guidance. When using its mail merge advice, review recipient lists and generated output carefully before printing or sending because those lists may contain personal information.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: Mail merge guidance discusses recipient names, addresses, and emails, which is expected for document productivity help; it would benefit from a privacy reminder but does not indicate hidden or disproportionate behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789063941043}}}}}